### 1. Create Job & Upload DWG
POST http://localhost:3000/api/job
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=BOUNDARY

--BOUNDARY
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.dwg"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< ./test.dwg
--BOUNDARY--

### 2. Query Job Status (replace :id with actual job_id)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/job/:id

### 3. Download Result ZIP (replace :id with actual job_id)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/job/:id/download

### 4. Error: Query non-existent job
GET http://localhost:3000/api/job/999999

### 5. Error: Download non-existent result
GET http://localhost:3000/api/job/999999/download 